	("Cheek Pouch", "If this Pokemon eats a held Berry, it restores 1/3 of its maximum HP, rounded down, in addition to the Berry''s effect. This effect can also activate after the effects of Bug Bite, Fling, Pluck, Stuff Cheeks, and Teatime if the eaten Berry had an effect on this Pokemon.", 1),
