	("Sheer Force", "This Pokemon''s attacks with secondary effects have their power multiplied by 1.3, but the secondary effects are removed. If a secondary effect was removed, it also removes the use'r's Life Orb recoil and Shell Bell recovery, and prevents the targ'et's Anger Shell, Berserk, Color Change, Emergency Exit, Pickpocket, Wimp Out, Red Card, Eject Button, Kee Berry, and Maranga Berry from activating.", 1),
